nt-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">신청 후 교수님 확인여부를 수시로 체크하여야 최종승인을 받을 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">교무과에서 접수내역 차수별 선승인과 최종승인을 동시에 처리</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">최종 승인이 되면 승인 기간 내 수업은 일괄로 조기취업자출석인정처리 됨</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.2pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 6pt; line-height: 12.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 6pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.2pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 40.3px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">조기취업자 출석인정신청 기한 및 증빙서류제출기한</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.2pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; lin